sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Programmer
    participant UI as Track Controller UI (QML)
    participant S as TrackControllerState
    participant W as TrackController (wayside)
    participant C as plc
    participant M as SwTrackController
    P->>UI: click Commit iteration
    UI->>S: commit()
    alt canCommit is false: no clean run of this exact buffer
        S->>S: commit internal: _log(commit refused, and why)
        S-->>UI: emit terminalChanged
    else verified
        S->>W: commit(buffer, file_name)
        W->>C: compile_program(source)
        C-->>W: return Program
        W->>W: commit internal: blocks_commit(diagnose(program)) refuses any diagnostic
        W->>W: commit internal: replace(program, number, file_name, committed_at), history keeps the last 5
        W-->>S: return the numbered Program
        S->>W: scan()
        W->>W: scan internal: _run(the committed program)
        S-->>UI: emit bufferChanged, controllerChanged: COMMITTED
        opt every wayside on the line now has a program
            UI->>S: ready, notReadyReason
            S->>M: ready, not_ready_reasons()
            M-->>S: return true, no reasons
            UI-->>P: NOT READY cleared
            Note right of M: From the next step the line's waysides run and report ready (UC-09, UC-17).
        end
    end
